#: credentials.php:751
msgid "A unique, meaningful name for this credential."
msgstr "Suna na musamman mai ma'ana ga wannan shaidar shiga."

#: credentials.php:759
msgid "An optional description of where this credential is used."
msgstr "Bayanin zaɓi na inda ake amfani da wannan shaidar shiga."

#: credentials.php:766
msgid "Credential Type"
msgstr "Nau'in Shaidar Shiga"

#: credentials.php:767
msgid "The type of credential. Changing the type on an existing credential discards the previously stored type-specific values when you save."
msgstr "Nau'in shaidar shiga. Canja nau'in akan shaidar shiga da ke akwai yana zubar da ƙimomin nau'in da aka ajiye a baya lokacin da kuka ajiye."

#: credentials.php:774
msgid "Where the secret values for this credential live. Choose the local encrypted database, or an external secret store. When an external provider is selected, each secret field holds a reference the provider resolves at poll time instead of the secret itself."
msgstr "Inda ƙimomin sirri na wannan shaidar shiga suke zama. Zaɓi rumbun bayanai na gida a ɓoye, ko wurin adana sirri na waje. Lokacin da aka zaɓi mai samar da sirri na waje, kowane filin sirri yana riƙe da manuniya da mai samar da sirri ke warwarewa a lokacin tattarawa maimakon sirrin da kansa."

#: credentials.php:781
msgid "Whether this credential is available for use."
msgstr "Ko wannan shaidar shiga tana samuwa don amfani."

#: credentials.php:822
msgid "(reference)"
msgstr "(manuniya)"

#: credentials.php:879
