msgstr "Canja Nau'in Shaidar Shiga?"

#: credentials.php:880
msgid "Changing the Credential Type will discard the values stored for the current type when you save this credential. Do you want to continue?"
msgstr "Canja Nau'in Shaidar Shiga zai zubar da ƙimomin da aka ajiye don nau'in yanzu lokacin da kuka ajiye wannan shaidar shiga. Kuna son ci gaba?"

