msgstr "OpenBao"

#: includes/providers/OpenBaoProvider.php:44
msgid "Resolve secrets from an OpenBao KV v1 or v2 secrets engine using a token or AppRole."
msgstr "Nemo sirrika daga injin sirri na OpenBao KV v1 ko v2 ta amfani da alamar shiga ko AppRole."

#: includes/providers/OpenBaoProvider.php:48
msgid "An OpenBao secret path and the key within it, separated by '#', for example 'network/snmp#community'. The path is relative to the configured KV mount; append '#key' to select a field from the secret."
msgstr "Hanyar sirrin OpenBao da maɓallin cikinta, an raba su da '#', misali 'network/snmp#community'. Hanyar tana dogara da wurin hawa na KV da aka saita; ƙara '#key' don zaɓar fili daga sirrin."

