msgstr "Alamar shiga ta OpenBao da ake amfani da ita don tabbatarwar Token. An ajiye ta a ɓoye."

#: includes/providers/OpenBaoProvider.php:59
msgid "Verify the OpenBao server TLS certificate. Disable only for testing."
msgstr "Tabbatar da takardar shaidar TLS ta uwar garken OpenBao. Kashe don gwaji kawai."

#: includes/providers/OpenBaoProvider.php:60
