msgstr "Hanya ta zaɓi akan uwar garken Cacti zuwa fakitin PEM CA da ake amfani da shi don tabbatar da OpenBao."

#: includes/providers/OpenBaoProvider.php:61
msgid "The network timeout for OpenBao requests."
msgstr "Ƙarewar lokacin hanyar sadarwa don buƙatun OpenBao."

